# Excludes files from static-asset UPLOAD. gitignore syntax.
#
# This matters MORE here than in the app repo: there is no build step, so the
# assets directory IS the repo root. Anything not listed here gets uploaded and
# served publicly. Workers excludes nothing automatically.
#
# _headers, _redirects and .assetsignore itself are excluded by Workers and do
# not need listing — everything else does.
.git
.gitignore
wrangler.toml
vercel.json

# The numbered-stray class from this machine's file duplicator. Both shapes:
# with an extension ("index 2.html") and without ("LICENSE 2"). The `*` after
# [0-9] is load-bearing — a single-character class stops at 9.
** [0-9]*
** [0-9]*.*
**/.DS_Store
